OL,3,GNEWSA'It's not that we're not trying',
OL,4,Asay young job-seekers
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's not that we're not trying, it's
OL,7,Fjust some of us have to work a bit
OL,8,Fharder," says 16-year-old Isabella.
OL,10,FShe is one of eight young people aged
OL,11,F16 to 19 on a youth study programme in
OL,12,FWeymouth, Dorset.
OL,14,FThey are working towards maths or
OL,15,FEnglish qualifications and taking part
OL,16,Fin a City & Guilds employability
OL,17,Fcourse.
OL,19,FBut the scheme is oversubscribed and
OL,20,Fhas a waiting list.
